  "about": "Reference forms on a wiki page and the normalized ids they give. Shared by plan-status-sweep (sweep-lib.test.ts) and muninn's live-chip parser (PR 3b). Synthetic owners, repos, numbers and titles only. Per case: readerConfig is the wiki's .wiki-reader.json (prGrammar, trackers), ownerFlag the sweep's --owner. Per row: page is the whole page, titles the PR titles a lookup returns (a bare #n with no title does not resolve), keys the page's key set (sorted), bodyKeys the distinct key mentions the body pattern finds in text order (code fences included), ids the distinct PR ids the sweep keeps in text order (a bare #n or PR #n only when its title carries a page key as a whole number), marked the ids muninn's reader marks (all of ids with a prGrammar; only pull URLs and owner/repo#n without one). Per case, noProd maps repo ids to whether prGrammar.noProd lists them (the match ignores case).",
